    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the trigger is unmet, so the duty does not arise; `o 33 r 21(4) the required exhibit is exhibited in the affidavit verifying the facts (the duty arises)` says so (open convention question QD)

