-- src:4858 | (6) Where a defendant to a counterclaim in an action in rem fails to serve a defence to counterclaim on the defendant making the counterclaim, then, subject to paragraph (7), after the expiration of the period fixed by these Rules for service of the defence to counterclaim and upon filing — ( a )
