-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§§ `Rules 22 to 24 -- order for sale of ship, priority of claims, appraisement and sale, undertakings`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- r 22(1): after the order for sale, a party with judgment may apply by summons for an order of priority: (a) where the order for sale contains the further order of paragraph (2), after the period specified under (2)(a) expires; (b) otherwise, after obtaining judgment.
