    `o 33 r 22(2)(a) that the order of priority of the claims must not be determined until after the expiration of 90 days or of such other period as the Court may specify`
    `o 33 r 22(2)(b) that any party may apply to the Court to extend the period specified in the order`
    `o 33 r 22(2)(c) that within 14 days after payment into Court of the proceeds of sale the Sheriff must send for publication a notice complying with paragraph (3)`
    `o 33 r 22(2) any other order`

