§§ `Rules 25 to 28 -- payment into and out of Court; directions; fixing the trial date; stay until security is given`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

DECLARE `o 33 r 25(1) rule of Order 14` IS ONE OF
    `o 33 r 25(1) Rule 3 of Order 14`
    `o 33 r 25(1) Rule 4 of Order 14`
    `o 33 r 25(1) Rule 5 of Order 14`
    `o 33 r 25(1) Rule 12 of Order 14`
    `o 33 r 25(1) any other Rule of Order 14`

-- r 25(1): "Order 14 (except Rules 3, 4, 5 and 12 of that Order) applies".  "Except" names four Rules that do not apply: JUST FALSE for them (open convention question QE).
